===Etymology===
[[File:Nene kauai RWD.jpg|thumb|A nene or [[Hawaiian goose]] (''[[Branta sandvicensis]]'') on [[Kauai]], [[Hawaii]], USA. It is the world’s rarest goose.]]

{{bor|en|haw|nēnē}}, which is imitative of the bird’s call.

